{"lang":"en","summary":"Navigation: 多智能体系统MOC | 面试总览","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"CrewAI的多Agent实现原理\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"多智能体系统\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> intermediate\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> medium\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/多智能体\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/intermediate</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%A4%9A%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%93%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9FMOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%A4%9A%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%93%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9FMOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">多智能体系统MOC</a> | <a data-href=\"面试总览\" href=\"面试总览\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">面试总览</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"CrewAI的多Agent实现原理\" dir=\"auto\">CrewAI的多Agent实现原理</h1>\n<h2 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">请深入分析CrewAI实现多Agent协作的内部原理，包括Agent如何定义角色、Task如何传递上下文、Process如何控制执行流程，以及其底层是否真的实现了Agent并行执行。</p>\n<h4 data-heading=\"答案\" dir=\"auto\">答案</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>CrewAI的内部实现原理</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">CrewAI的多Agent协作基于三个核心机制：<strong>角色隔离</strong>、<strong>上下文传递</strong>和<strong>流程编排</strong>。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>1. 角色隔离机制</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">CrewAI中的Agent并非独立进程，而是通过<strong>System Message隔离</strong>实现角色区分：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token comment\"># CrewAI内部实现逻辑（简化）</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Agent</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> role<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> goal<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> backstory<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 角色信息被编码到System Message中</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>system_prompt <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"\"\"\n        你是</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>role<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">。你的目标是</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>goal<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">。\n        你的背景：</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>backstory<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">。\n        你只能以</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>role<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">的身份行动，不能替代其他角色。\n        \"\"\"</span></span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>llm <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>bind<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>system_message<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>system_prompt<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 本质上，CrewAI通过不同的System Prompt让同一个LLM\"扮演\"不同角色</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>2. 上下文传递机制</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Task之间通过<code class=\"code-styler-inline\">context</code>参数建立依赖关系，CrewAI内部维护任务输出映射：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token comment\"># CrewAI任务上下文传递（简化）</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Crew</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">execute</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        task_outputs <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> task <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tasks<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 1. 收集依赖任务的输出作为上下文</span>\n            context <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"\"</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> dep_task <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> task<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>context<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                context <span class=\"token operator\">+=</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"\\n</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>dep_task<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>description<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">的输出:\\n</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>task_outputs<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>dep_task<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token builtin\">id</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\\n\"</span></span>\n\n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 2. 构建完整的Prompt</span>\n            full_prompt <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"\"\"\n            上下文信息：</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>context<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\n            你的任务：</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>task<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>description<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\n            期望输出：</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>task<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>expected_output<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\n            \"\"\"</span></span>\n\n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 3. 分配给指定Agent执行</span>\n            agent <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> task<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>agent\n            output <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> agent<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>execute<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>full_prompt<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            task_outputs<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>task<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token builtin\">id</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> output\n\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> task_outputs\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>3. Process执行流程</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">CrewAI支持两种Process模式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Process模式</th>\n<th>实现方式</th>\n<th>是否并行</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Sequential</strong></td>\n<td>按任务列表顺序执行，等待每个任务完成</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Hierarchical</strong></td>\n<td>LLM扮演Manager动态生成子任务并分配</td>\n<td>部分并行</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>关于并行执行的事实：</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">CrewAI早期版本（&lt;0.30）实际上<strong>不支持真正的并行执行</strong>。所有任务都是顺序执行的。新版本通过<code class=\"code-styler-inline\">Flows</code>特性引入了并行能力：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token comment\"># 新版本的Flows支持并行（ CrewAI Flows）</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> crewai<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>flow <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> Flow<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> start<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> listen\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">MyFlow</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>Flow<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token decorator annotation punctuation\">@start</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">research</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 启动研究任务</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>researcher<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>kickoff<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"研究主题\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token decorator annotation punctuation\">@listen</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>research<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">write</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> research_result<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 等待研究完成后开始写作</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>writer<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>kickoff<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>research_result<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token decorator annotation punctuation\">@listen</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>research<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">analyze</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> research_result<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 与分析任务并行（如果依赖相同）</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>analyzer<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>kickoff<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>research_result<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>CrewAI的架构层次：</strong></p>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">CrewAI架构\n┌─────────────────────────────────────┐\n│           Crew（团队）                │\n│    任务调度 │ 流程控制 │ 结果聚合       │\n├─────────────────────────────────────┤\n│           Task（任务）                │\n│    描述 │ 期望输出 │ 依赖关系 │ Agent绑定│\n├─────────────────────────────────────┤\n│           Agent（智能体）             │\n│    System Prompt │ LLM │ 工具 │ 记忆   │\n├─────────────────────────────────────┤\n│           LLM调用层                   │\n│    OpenAI / Anthropic / 本地模型       │\n└─────────────────────────────────────┘\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h4 data-heading=\"延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">延伸追问</h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问1</strong>：CrewAI的Agent是真正的独立实体吗？\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">答：不是。CrewAI的Agent是逻辑抽象，通过不同的System Prompt让LLM扮演不同角色。它们共享同一个Python进程，通过内存传递上下文，不是独立进程或独立LLM实例。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问2</strong>：CrewAI适合什么样的生产场景？\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">答：适合角色定义清晰、流程相对固定的场景，如内容创作团队、研究分析团队、代码审查流程。不适合需要复杂条件分支、实时响应、高频交互的场景。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 data-heading=\"常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">常见误区</h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区</strong>：CrewAI的多个Agent同时运行并互相通信。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>纠正</strong>：CrewAI的Agent实际上是顺序执行的，通过任务输出传递信息，而非真正的并发运行。每个时刻只有一个Agent在调用LLM。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"相关知识点\" dir=\"auto\">相关知识点</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%A4%9A%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%93%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9FMOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%A4%9A%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%93%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9FMOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">多智能体系统MOC</a></li>\n</ul>","headings":[]}